# Bubble Wash Kingdom: environment variable NAMES only (no values). Never commit a real key.
# Tripo: the key is a network secret of the cloud environment (host openapi.tripo3d.ai); the CLI only needs a placeholder:
TRIPO_API_KEY=proxy-injected
# Android preview builds (Tools/android_apk/build_apk.sh):
ANDROID_HOME=$HOME/android-sdk
